      "question": "Does correction taking ledger without employeeanchor prove reverse anchor cycle?",
      "answer": "NO immediate reverse acquisition in inspected handler: correction takes Attendance then Ledger but never later acquires employee UPDLOCK. Payout does not acquire Attendance. Crosshandler/commonactualSQLplan analysis and checkout EFwrite order are not certified here."
    },
